@no_majority_one
title: There is a hung Parliament.
view-if: hung_parliament == 1 and labour_r <= 50 and tories_r <= 50 and liberals_r <= 50

Its a hung parliament. No party has won a majority, so deals will have to be made to decide the government.

- @no_majority_conservative_one: Conservative Minority
- @no_majority_Labour_one: Labour Minority
- @no_majority_liberal_one: Liberal Minority

